{"rpid": "2820681", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "新人曜冰", "mid": "102920", "level": 6, "vip": 1, "content": "Ice and fire arrows——————冰与火之箭……\nWerebears! – huge werewolf creatures that are bigger than bears. Scary!——————熊人……\nLycanthropy-specific (werewolf) skill tree——————熊人拥有独特的技能树= =\nBecome a flying Vampire Lord -awesome——————可以变成会飞的恶魔……\nNew Vampire imp minions——————美艳的吸血鬼下属～～\nNew Mudcrab animations——————添加新泥沼蟹动画\nGiant Mudcrab enemy – this guys pretty big! Comes out of the ground like some sort of RE monster.——————超超超超超巨大的泥沼蟹", "like": 4, "ctime": 1328811131, "rcount": 1, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "213487", "video_bvid": "BV1Hx411w7WC", "video_title": "上古卷轴5 B社工作人员制作的给力MOD！", "video_desc": "youku 1：15秒正片开始，各种给力MOD", "video_owner": "呦，籽殚君", "video_view": 21409, "video_reply": 59, "video_n1": 51, "video_n2": 8}
{"rpid": "2820679", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "新人曜冰", "mid": "102920", "level": 6, "vip": 1, "content": "List favourite followers in the game's menu——————最爱同伴的菜单（跟偏好一样吧）\nBuild your own home from scratch – comes with skeleton butler!——————雇佣骷髅建筑师来建筑你自己的房子……\nAdopt children——————收养儿童（不会成为第二个慈祥贵罗吧……）\nCombine magic to create new attacks——————组合魔法来创造新的攻击方式例如：火焰术+复生僵尸=召唤火元素；恐惧+疗伤=吸取生命\nGoblin enemies – horrible looking enemies with spears——————新敌人，装备长矛的哥布林\n'Way Gate' fast travel – kind of like a portal system——————传送门（貌似不用读盘）\nEpic mounts like a flaming horse——————史诗坐骑，看起来像烈焰战马\nMounted combat on horses – fight whist riding a horse——————骑马与砍杀………………\nDragon mounts – how cool is that!——————骑龙与砍杀（能控制他喷火耶！）………………\n'Soul bug' familiar——————跟着你飞的小虫，替你收集死去敌人的灵魂\nKinect-enabled 'shouts' – good luck saying those words with your girlfriend nearby——————语音控制龙吼，小心你旁边的女朋友……\nEnhanced water effects – clearer objects underwater——————更真实的水下视觉\nFootprints in the snow——————踏雪有痕\nBetter animations for fabrics——————更细致的衣服面料\nVaried enemies, like fat giants – who ate all the pies——————多样化的敌人，比如患有肥胖症的巨人……", "like": 4, "ctime": 1328811117, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "213487", "video_bvid": "BV1Hx411w7WC", "video_title": "上古卷轴5 B社工作人员制作的给力MOD！", "video_desc": "youku 1：15秒正片开始，各种给力MOD", "video_owner": "呦，籽殚君", "video_view": 21409, "video_reply": 59, "video_n1": 51, "video_n2": 8}
{"rpid": "2820677", "root": "0", "parent": "0", "uname": "新人曜冰", "mid": "102920", "level": 6, "vip": 1, "content": "Seasonal foliage – trees turning brown, snow falling——————季节变化\nFlow based water shader – water flowing at different speeds——————不同水域不同的水面显示\nSpears as weapons with a new animation system – new weapons!——————长矛将作为拥有独立攻击方式的武器加入游戏\nKill cams for ranged combat (follow the arrow!) and magic – see that last kill from different angles.——————弓箭和魔法将拥有杀敌特效\nNew stealth options like water arrows and assassinations – see through walls and other objects with assassins vision.——————水箭（可熄灭火炬）和刺客视觉……E叔的鹰眼么……\nGuards relight areas——————守卫和敌人会重新点燃熄灭的火炬\nParalysis runes – paralyse your enemies with this weapon——————麻痹符文、麻痹附魔\nDungeon enhancements - moving platforms and hanging structures——————迷宫改进，比如拥有移动的平台之类的\nWater currents in dungeons – channels and canals of water——————迷宫中的水道，主角可以向坐滑梯一样……\nReally dark dungeons - requiring you to light your path as you progress——————完全黑暗的迷宫，需要自己创造光源\nNew companion commands – combat style, training, distance and equipment——————新的同伴选项，战斗方式、训练、跟随距离、装备\n", "like": 1, "ctime": 1328811060, "rcount": 0, "ip": "", "images": [], "video_aid": "213487", "video_bvid": "BV1Hx411w7WC", "video_title": "上古卷轴5 B社工作人员制作的给力MOD！", "video_desc": "youku 1：15秒正片开始，各种给力MOD", "video_owner": "呦，籽殚君", "video_view": 21409, "video_reply": 59, "video_n1": 51, "video_n2": 8}
